# Deep Learning

- FEATURE_DIM **34**; lookback/granularity/`label_horizon_bars` do checkpoint devem bater com settings
- Label SSOT `quantum_multi_barrier` (alternativas: `triple_barrier`, `supertrend_atr`); horizonte **N=1 vela M5**; contrato ops **5 m**; treino em dados diários (**D1 / 86.400 s**, 365 barras)
- Sweep `horizon_sweep`: grade M5 com $N \in [1, 2, 3, 4]$ barras; `quiet_train_logs` → overlay celula **CRITICAL** + linha cell com `why=` se deploy=0; pos-sweep denso (board/winner/promote/Timescale/meta)
- `train.py` vs `run.py`; meta offline em `scripts/operations/train_meta_*`
- Inferencia TCN = eager/CUDA **local no host** (`inference_mode`, batch 1); nao bloquear o event loop — offload se pesado; meta/loss HTTP sidecars com timeout/fallback
- Optuna/tuning offline: nao disputar VRAM com inferencia live; artefatos versionados no MinIO
- ACC / val_accuracy gate importa; nao ignorar deploy_gate; gate pos-promote tambem aceita settle elegivel
- Sample weighting SSOT: `deep_learning.sample_weighting` — class balance + recency (`recency_half_life_n` default **500**); `compose_train_weights` no walkforward
- Majority-collapse no deploy: `reject_majority_collapse`, `max_label_call_frac_bias` (0.20), `min_minority_recall` (0.25); telemetria `label_call_frac` / `pred_call_frac` / `minority_recall`
- Calibracao: modo `raw_extreme` substituiu `tcn_macro_override` — raw extremo **nao** substitui Cal; Kelly usa Cal; clamp `[raw±0.08]` **antes** da zona neutra; `min_calibration_margin_floor` **0.03**; call/put **0.53/0.47**; chaves `tcn_macro_*_override` so limiam raw (nao sao TF MACRO OHLC)
- Vies de classe corrige-se no treino/deploy, nao com veto de sinal live
- Doc: `docs/engineering-deep-learning.md` + `docs/engineering-architecture-senior.md`; skill: `aether-dl-train`
